LOCachy generic x86-64 installation environment

The full-screen installer runs on this console (tty1); to start it again:
  installer
Without it: nmtui (the network), then locachy-install (asks on the console)
or locachy-install --help (every option).
The running installation environment is separate from the target root.
The installer menu offers Rescue mode and Terminal as separate programs.
Rescue mode also has its own boot entry; it asks before disk unlock or cable access.
The ordinary SSH service and cloud provisioning are disabled.
Only Rescue can explicitly start its separate authenticated cable service.

